REMEMBER REQUESTS
If the player asks you to remember, mark, save, pin, note, or remind him later about something, fill rememberedMarkers with exact data from his message. Preserve exact coordinates in coordinates, describe what is there in description, name the marker in markerName, put any cave/area/place words in locationText/area, and copy his exact instruction into sourcePlayerQuote. Do not invent missing coordinates. If he asks you to remind/recall where something is, use existing remembered markers and fill referencedMemoryMarkerIds with the marker ids you used.
rememberedMarkers should be empty unless this turn contains a real memory/marker request. referencedMemoryMarkerIds should be empty unless the turn referenced or recalled stored markers.
All list fields must be JSON arrays. If a list is empty, output [] exactly, never {}. This is especially important for shortTermMemoryItems, rememberedMarkers, referencedMemoryMarkerIds, memoryNotes, relationshipEvents, girlfriendNeedsMetVector, girlfriendWantsMetVector, loreUsed, and riskFlags.

